DEFINITELY not the potions. It's not worth it to burn a wish on
something you're guaranteed to get later (xp, obviously not in
particular the potions). No reason to rush the quest, Sceptre is great
but you can work your way all the way down to the castle getting xp.
You'll have to get xp anyway, may as well do it the long way while you
stack up good eq. Incidentally, if you are going to wish for something
to give you levels, reverse-genociding wraiths works better than !oGL
anyway.

Personally I'd go with GDSM. Since you're not able to twoweapon, using
a shield of reflection isn't out of the question, and you may find one
in Perseus' statue. Especially with this being the farthest you've
gotten, GDSM just increases survivability SO much that you'll love
it.


